{"type":"text","timestamp":1790360915415,"sessionID":"ses_f262f5ef9ffep3pwLttuFyUlPl","part":{"id":"prt_0d9d38db7001a6GFxxIyr36MCW","messageID":"msg_0d9d35aa6001socEeBI9F30l7P","sessionID":"ses_f262f5ef9ffep3pwLttuFyUlPl","type":"text","text":"The implementation is in place: `_ready()` applies the shader at `54.0`, recursively visits descendant meshes, copies base color and scalar material values plus available textures, and assigns a per-surface `ShaderMaterial`. I’m running the project now to catch parser/runtime issues and inspect the rendered result.","time":{"start":1790360915383,"end":1790360915387},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_02efe72546f8f816016ab6bd4ac57c81979c156b9d2b787c09","phase":"commentary"}}}}
